{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_044_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45fe81751ba1547592204ef5aac029e92698000aecae25e79de04318734ab068",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc5ab2860749e809b21fdb33e38295011ca06fda3a1563b4a774bc8b61465d51",
      "text": "打扫事务所即是净化心灵",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df137f69125ad05bb41b0917366f9d0338d9918e3fb083caecc905e0302dd69",
      "text": "雨彦发现制作人的肩头有脏污，\n便帮忙掸拭干净。制作人觉得肩膀变轻了。\n雨彦开玩笑说也许除了脏污还驱除了别的东西，引得两人发笑。改天，\n两人决定一起打扫事务所……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc5ab2860749e809b21fdb33e38295011ca06fda3a1563b4a774bc8b61465d51",
      "text": "打扫事务所即是净化心灵",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70be1cf46022b22fb69b573f1cc5f919b66fce59287ea5de5e287a7bed0c9b8a",
      "text": "呼……会议总算结束了呢。\n辛苦您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:320a4e9701494848a17e48ee7126d288a0564707815e0c124e02a4c744eea78f",
      "text": "啊啊，辛苦啦。今天电视台的工作人员、\n赞助商和制作公司，大家可都讨论得热火朝天啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59f4d40489f330fc8835e1a8985941e4980e88ecc5845b539053bc6939ac9fed",
      "text": "要不是你把大家的话整合好，\n估计还得拖更久吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45cca2bdcb3c2bbc4cc8802229e2d105f576b134b049e3a29c0b828d0e1c0e0c",
      "text": "雨彦先生的提议很切中要害，才是关键所在哦。\n非常感谢。您累了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fad6d7fedeaa816b3268006b323c04cf552011abadaaea8af1cdd6b02fdedca",
      "text": "我倒是没事，不过你……似乎已经累到\n连肩膀上的灰尘都注意不到了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a4171262b53f17eb1eb9e270071166067c30e79a1ee2bcc31ce99c37e5c7e7e",
      "text": "嘛，在那个位置确实看不见吧。\n我来帮你掸掉，稍微站着别动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e45863a31a87796b5867adabed6c2af97450864166a0fd0a19c8cb210ab079b",
      "text": "好嘞，弄掉了。\n变得干干净净的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75b2964bf5191c01233bbc1e27b0b820f7f91149b611f57dc371e705bcae1144",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n呵呵，总觉得肩膀好像变轻了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66d15a96f9fd215fd58a92565c6452bcc9555ccd7faa16b362eb3a1a8e16f473",
      "text": "哈哈，在掸掉灰尘的同时，\n说不定顺便把别的东西也给驱除掉了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:257e1bb2034c4c6475440a3beba688819dde98f643cac54c50a5c86680a842b4",
      "text": "啊哈哈。说不定还真是这样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
